.TH ACCT 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
acct \- enables process accounting at path or disables it with null; requires privilege
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int acct(const char* path);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enables process accounting at path or disables it with NULL; requires privilege.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR acct (2)
